      "effect": "layout",
      "evidence": "Appendix C specifies the 30% target; Section 5, Eq. (14) constrains the intermediate densities; the text following Eq. (17) permits either a volume-conserving threshold or a fixed threshold of 0.5 without selecting one for Fig. 5."
